  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 43061557,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_5_430-451",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "430-451",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所谓靠谱，就是收到做到、说到做到、想到做到",
      "totalCount": 2002
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 32105241,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_4_1614-1679",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "1614-1679",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成功是一城一池的得失，有周期性，有偶然性，也容易得而复失，而成长，则是从山底到山腰，又到山顶的过程，人一旦成长，就再无退步的可能。",
      "totalCount": 1053
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 362885832,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_13_738-792",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "738-792",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所有的付出，本质上都是得到。你做成的每一件事情，都是你辽阔人生的一部分，没有任何人可以抢得走。",
      "totalCount": 780
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_73_697-739",
      "chapterUid": 73,
      "range": "697-739",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "小的欲望，放纵即可获得；中等欲望，靠克制才能得到；而上等的欲望，则需要一天天地煎熬。",
      "totalCount": 663
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 267822384,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_6_425-499",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "425-499",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "靠谱的人就是收到做到、说到做到、想到做到的人。靠谱的事就是难而正确的事。靠谱的关系就是双向奔赴或有能量流入的关系。我们一生都应该追随这些靠谱的事物。",
      "totalCount": 590
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_11_854-892",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "854-892",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "要么学会拒绝，要么就对承诺的事情交付确定性，这是一个工作高手必须具备的美德。",
      "totalCount": 572
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_6_1698-1712",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "1698-1712",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "靠谱，是对一个人的最高评价。",
      "totalCount": 561
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 62530215,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_45_472-604",
      "chapterUid": 45,
      "range": "472-604",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不要根据你拥有的资源、认知、能力去定义一件事情的可能性。 你要根据你的目标去配置、去拓展你的资源、能力和认知。 不是因为你有什么，而是因为需要你有什么。",
      "totalCount": 546
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 39959500,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_8_554-580",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "554-580",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "找导师的要求就一个：要远比你强，强到你可以对他服气。",
      "totalCount": 544
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_11_645-689",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "645-689",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "同事有很多，但战友却不多，只有那种你将任务交付给他，他想尽一切办法去完成的，才能叫战友。",
      "totalCount": 544
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_104_1860-1981",
      "chapterUid": 104,
      "range": "1860-1981",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "没有一朵花， 一开始便是花； 也没有一朵花， 直到最后仍是花。",
      "totalCount": 540
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_23_1699-1747",
      "chapterUid": 23,
      "range": "1699-1747",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们生命中最重要的不是得到，而是付出。付出，不一定在此刻有收获，但一定会在未来的某一刻如数呈现。",
      "totalCount": 525
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 70453872,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_42_429-468",
      "chapterUid": 42,
      "range": "429-468",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "知识和认知最大的不同是，前者只存在于头脑中，而后者，还需要付诸行动，并交付成果",
      "totalCount": 473
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 267822384,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_23_518-543",
      "chapterUid": 23,
      "range": "518-543",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "跳槽频繁，至少证明了一个人选择和坚持的能力比较弱。",
      "totalCount": 468
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 318284058,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_43_3294-3322",
      "chapterUid": 43,
      "range": "3294-3322",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "勤奋和读书一样，也许是一个人能够逃离原生阶层的又一机会。",
      "totalCount": 468
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 12964577,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_32_948-1003",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "948-1003",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个优秀的人在做事前，能够投入三分之一的时间和注意力不断调查研究，然后不断行动，不断试错，不断超越，最终成事。",
      "totalCount": 435
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 371541227,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_40_954-994",
      "chapterUid": 40,
      "range": "954-994",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人不应该无条件地接受所有的信息，应该只关注那些能让自己和事情本身变得更好的部分。",
      "totalCount": 420
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 331595062,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_46_571-589",
      "chapterUid": 46,
      "range": "571-589",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "1.周期。周期对塑造成功者影响最大。",
      "totalCount": 416
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 78601809,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_19_538-592",
      "chapterUid": 19,
      "range": "538-592",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所谓精确表达，是非常直接、清晰地描述任务本身的内容以及你安排的目的，必须明确责任人、截止日期、关键考评指标。",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300043691",
      "userVid": 355613026,
      "bookmarkId": "3300043691_76_976-1040",
      "chapterUid": 76,
      "range": "976-1040",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果你遇到一个障碍，只要你拼尽全力地寻找，一定能找到一个更优解。在你一筹莫展的三里之外，解决方案也许正静静地躺着等待着你的发现。",
      "totalCount": 374
    }
  ],
